WEBVTT

00:12:57.204 --> 00:13:02.055
and when it's ready to coordinate
the final chord with me.

00:13:02.079 --> 00:13:04.816
(Music)

00:13:09.783 --> 00:13:11.783
(Music ending)

00:13:14.103 --> 00:13:15.104
(Final chord)

00:13:15.128 --> 00:13:20.882
(Applause)

00:13:20.906 --> 00:13:22.061
Thanks.

00:13:22.085 --> 00:13:23.666
I hope you see

00:13:23.690 --> 00:13:28.086
how much this part of the body
that doesn't touch the instrument

00:13:28.110 --> 00:13:30.702
actually helps
with the musical performance.